sequenceDiagram
    actor V as Viewer (browser)
    participant R as rrotor (the org's host)
    participant G as Glyphh server
    V->>R: GET /apps/sign_in_flow/
    R-->>V: 302 to /auth/start (no session yet)
    V->>G: /oauth/authorize (PKCE, rrotor as the client)
    G-->>V: sign in to Glyphh, approve
    V->>R: GET /auth/callback?code=
    R->>G: POST /oauth/token
    R-->>V: session cookie, then back to /apps/sign_in_flow/
    R->>G: POST /v1/runtime/introspect (sub, role, groups)
    R-->>V: the diagram, when approved and a role allows
